      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 歡迎"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "這是 [*Think Python*，第 3 版](https://greenteapress.com/wp/think-python-3rd-edition) 第 1 章的 Jupyter 筆記本，由 Allen B. Downey 撰寫。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您不熟悉 Jupyter 筆記本，\n",
        "\n",
        "[點此查看簡介](https://colab.research.google.com/github/AllenDowney/ThinkPython/blob/v3/chapters/jupyter_intro.ipynb)。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "然後，如果您尚未在 Colab 上運行此筆記本，[點此在 Colab 上運行此筆記本](https://colab.research.google.com/github/AllenDowney/ThinkPython/blob/v3/chapters/chap01.ipynb)。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "以下儲存格會下載一個檔案並執行一些特定於此書籍的程式碼。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from os.path import basename, exists\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def download(url):\n",
        "    filename = basename(url)\n",
        "    if not exists(filename):\n",
        "        from urllib.request import urlretrieve\n",
        "\n",
        "        local, _ = urlretrieve(url, filename)\n",
        "        print('Downloaded ' + str(local))\n",
        "    return filename\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "download('https://github.com/AllenDowney/ThinkPython/raw/v3/thinkpython.py');\n",
        "\n",
        "import thinkpython"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# 程式設計作為一種思考方式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "這本書的第一個目標是教你如何用 Python 程式設計。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "但學習程式設計意味著學習一種新的思考方式，所以這本書的第二個目標是幫助你像電腦科學家一樣思考。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "這種思考方式結合了數學、工程和自然科學的最佳特點。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "像數學家一樣，電腦科學家使用形式語言來表示想法——特別是計算。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "像工程師一樣，他們設計事物，將元件組裝成系統並評估替代方案之間的權衡。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "像科學家一樣，他們觀察複雜系統的行為，形成假設並測試預測。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "我們將從程式設計的最基本元素開始，一步步向上。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "在這一章，我們將看到 Python 如何表示數字、字母和單詞。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "你也將學習程式設計的詞彙，包括像運算元、運算式、值和類型等術語。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "這種詞彙很重要——你需要它來理解這本書的其餘部分、與其他程式設計師溝通，以及使用和理解虛擬助理。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 算術運算元"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**算術運算元** 是一個符號，代表算術運算，例如，加號 `+` 執行加法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "30 + 12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "減號 `-` 是執行減法的運算元。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "43 - 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "星號 `*` 執行乘法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "6 * 7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "正斜線 `/` 執行除法："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "84 / 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "請注意，除法的結果是 `42.0` 而不是 `42`。這是因為 Python 中有兩種數字類型："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* **整數**，代表沒有小數或小數部分的數字，以及"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* **浮點數**，代表整數和小數點的數字。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您將兩個整數相加、相減或相乘，結果是整數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "但如果您將兩個整數相除，結果是浮點數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Python 提供另一個運算元 `//`，它執行**整數除法**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "整數除法的結果始終是整數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "84 // 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "整數除法也被稱為\"向下取整除法\"，因為它總是向下取整（朝向\"地板\"）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "85 // 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "最後，運算元 `**` 執行指數運算；也就是將一個數字提升到一個次方："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "7 ** 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "在某些其他語言中，插入符號 `^` 用於指數運算，但是在 Python 中它是一個位元運算元，稱為 XOR。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您不熟悉位元運算元，結果可能出乎意料："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "7 ^ 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "我不會在本書中介紹位元運算元，但您可以在 <http://wiki.python.org/moin/BitwiseOperators> 閱讀有關它們的資訊。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 運算式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "運算元和數字的集合稱為**運算式**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "一個運算式可以包含任意數量的運算元和數字。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "例如，這是一個包含兩個運算元的運算式。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "6 + 6 ** 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "請注意，指數運算先發生。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Python 遵循您可能在數學課上學到的運算順序：指數運算先發生，然後是乘法和除法，然後是加法和減法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "在以下例子中，乘法先發生。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "12 + 5 * 6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您希望加法先發生，您可以使用括號。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "(12 + 5) * 6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "每個運算式都有一個**值**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "例如，運算式 `6 * 7` 的值是 `42`。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 算術函數"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "除了算術運算元，Python 還提供一些**函數**，這些函數用於處理數字。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "例如，`round` 函數將浮點數四捨五入到最接近的整數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "round(42.4)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "round(42.6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`abs` 函數計算數字的絕對值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "對於正數，絕對值就是數字本身。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "abs(42)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "對於負數，絕對值是正的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "abs(-42)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "當我們使用像這樣的函數時，我們說我們在**呼叫**函數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "一個呼叫函數的運算式是**函數呼叫**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "當您呼叫函數時，括號是必要的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您省略它們，您會得到錯誤訊息。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%%expect SyntaxError"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "abs 42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "注意：以下儲存格使用 `%%expect`，這是 Jupyter 的\"magic command\"，表示我們預期此儲存格中的程式碼會產生錯誤。如需更多資訊，請參閱 [Jupyter 筆記本簡介](https://colab.research.google.com/github/AllenDowney/ThinkPython/blob/v3/chapters/jupyter_intro.ipynb)。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 字串"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "除了數字，Python 還可以表示字母序列，這些序列稱為**字串**，因為字母像項鍊上的珠子一樣串在一起。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "要寫一個字串，我們可以將字母序列放在直雙引號內。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "'Hello'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "使用雙引號也是合法的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "\"world\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "雙引號讓寫包含撇號的字串變得容易，撇號和直雙引號是相同的符號。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "\"it's a small \""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "字串也可以包含空格、標點符號和數字。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "'Well, '"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`+` 運算元適用於字串；它將兩個字串連接成一個字串，這稱為**串連**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "'Well, ' + \"it's a small \" + 'world.'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`*` 運算元也適用於字串；它會建立多個字串的副本並串連它們。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "'Spam, ' * 4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "其他算術運算元不適用於字串。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Python 提供一個名為 `len` 的函數，計算字串的長度。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "len('Spam')"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "請注意，`len` 計算引號之間的字母，但不包括引號。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "當您建立字串時，請確保使用直雙引號。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "反引號，也稱為反單引號，會導致語法錯誤。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%%expect SyntaxError"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "`Hello`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "聰明引號，也稱為捲曲引號，也是非法的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%%expect SyntaxError"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "‘Hello’"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 值和類型"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "到目前為止，我們已經看到三種值："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* `2` 是一個整數，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* `42.0` 是一個浮點數，以及"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* `'Hello'` 是一個字串。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "一種值稱為**類型**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "每個值都有一個類型——或者我們有時說它\"屬於\"一個類型。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Python 提供一個名為 `type` 的函數，告訴您任何值的類型。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "type(2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "type(42.0)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "type('Hello, World!')"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "類型 `int`、`float` 和 `str` 可以用作函數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "例如，`int` 可以取一個浮點數並將其轉換為整數（始終向下取整）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "int(42.9)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "而 `float` 可以將整數轉換為浮點值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "float(42)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "現在，這可能會令人困惑。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您將數字序列放在引號中，會得到什麼？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "'126'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "看起來像數字，但實際上是一個字串。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "type('126')"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您嘗試像數字一樣使用它，您可能會得到錯誤。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%%expect TypeError"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "'126' / 3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "此例子產生 `TypeError`，這意味著運算式中的值，稱為**運算元**，類型錯誤。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "錯誤訊息表示 `/` 運算元不支援這些值的類型，這是 `str` 和 `int`。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您有一個包含數字的字串，您可以使用 `int` 將其轉換為整數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "int('126') / 3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "如果您有一個包含數字和小數點的字串，您可以使用 `float` 將其轉換為浮點數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "float('12.6')"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "當您寫一個大整數時，您可能會想要在數字群組之間使用逗號，就像 `1,000,000`。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "這在 Python 中是合法的運算式，但結果不是整數。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "1,000,000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Python 將 `1,000,000` 解釋為逗號分隔的整數序列。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "我們稍後會學到這種序列。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "您可以使用底線來讓大數字更容易閱讀。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "1_000_000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 形式語言和自然語言"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**自然語言** 是人們說的語言，如英語、西班牙語和法語。它們不是人們設計的；它們是自然演化的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**形式語言** 是人們為特定應用而設計的語言。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "例如，數學家使用的符號是一種形式語言，特別擅長表示數字和符號。所有程式語言都是形式語言。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "雖然形式語言和自然語言有一些共同特點，但有重要的差異："
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* 模糊性：自然語言充滿模糊性，人們通過使用上下文線索和其他資訊來處理。形式語言被設計成幾乎或完全無模糊性，這意味著任何程式都有一個確切的含義，無論上下文如何。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* 冗餘：為了彌補模糊性和減少誤解，自然語言使用冗餘。因此，它們通常很冗長。形式語言較少冗餘且更簡潔。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "* 字面性：自然語言充滿慣用語和隱喻。形式語言的意思就是它們所說的。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "因為我們都成長於說自然語言，所以有時很難適應形式語言。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "形式語言比自然語言更密集，因此閱讀它們需要更長時間。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "此外，結構很重要，所以並非總是最好從上到下、從左到右閱讀。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "最後，細節很重要。在拼寫和標點符號的細微錯誤中，您可以在自然語言中逃脫，但在形式語言中可能會造成重大差異。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 除錯"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "程式設計師會犯錯誤。出於異想天開的原因，程式設計錯誤被稱為**錯誤**，追蹤它們的過程被稱為**除錯**。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "程式設計，尤其是除錯，有時會引發強烈情緒。如果您正在努力解決一個困難的錯誤，您可能會感到生氣、難過或尷尬。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "為這些反應做準備可能有助於您應對它們。一種方法是將電腦視為具有某些優點的員工，例如速度和精確性，以及特定的缺點，例如缺乏同理心和無法掌握大局。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "您的任務是成為一名好經理：找到利用優點並減輕缺點的方法。並找到利用您的情緒來參與問題的方法，而不讓您的反應干擾您有效工作的能力。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "學習除錯可能令人沮喪，但這是一種有價值的技能，對許多活動都很有用。在每個章節的結尾，都有一個像這樣的區段，包含我對除錯的建議。我希望它們有幫助！"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 詞彙表"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**算術運算元：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "一個符號，像 `+` 和 `*`，表示算術運算，如加法或乘法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
